Description: Description: Provides a unified framework for applying and benchmarking
    normalisation methods for spatial transcriptomics data. The package
    supports quality control, spatially variable gene analysis,
    clustering, cell-type annotation, biological interpretation,
    visualisation, and other downstream analyses to evaluate the
    preservation of biological signals across normalisation methods.
